            "readonly": false,
            "desc": "Name the Arcron keeper whose app account may call `publish`.\nCreator-only, one-time. Pass the keeper *application*, not a raw uint64. `publish` authorizes Application(keeper).address  the inner-call sender when Arcron `execute()` inner-calls this app  never itob(keeper.id). Puya lowers the Application param to uint64 in the ABI signature; the compiled selector is set_keeper(uint64)void.",
            "events": [],
            "recommendations": {}
        },
        {
